</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Leipje.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">Wêt ji wol, war Leipje<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi> wahnt, Leipje wahnt bi't Pôrtje; Leipje het sîn Fro verköfft, Pund vör twê-un'n Oertje<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi>.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Kern, 147<hi rendition="#sup">a</hi>.</hi></p>                <lb/>
