<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">It.</hi>: Amato non sarai, se a te solo penserai. (<hi rendition="#i">Bohn II, 70; Cahier, 2793.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger"><cb n="172"/>
