<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*151 A loigt ärger ass a leefft.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Robinson, 561; Gomolcke, 162.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*152 A loigt sirrer (sehrer, mehr) as a lêft.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Schles.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, III, 416, 601.</hi></p>                <lb/>
