<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Poln.</hi>: L&#x017C;e, a&#x017C; &#x015B;ciany schna. &#x2013; L&#x017C;e, jak kalendarz. (<hi rendition="#i">Masson, 234.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*154 Ar lüagt, ass (dass) en di Ag'n (Augen) tropf'n.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Franken.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, VI, 320, 263.</hi></p>                <lb/>
