</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Luhuarken.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">* Hä lûhuarked<hi rendition="#sup">1</hi> as 'ne Sû'e, dä sichten<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi> härd.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Lüdenscheid.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, V, 161, 103 u. 110.</hi></p>                <lb/>
