<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Mortui nil amplius desiderant. (<hi rendition="#i">Eiselein, 442.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Magnichtmehr.</hi></head>                <lb/>
