<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">1387 Ôler Mann öss bôld geschlage, ôlet Wîw bôld op e Narsch gestott.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Friedland in Preussen.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frischbier<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi>, 46.</hi></p>                <lb/>
