<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Ad id, unde aliquis flatus ostenditur, vela dare. &#x2013; Duabus se venditat partibus. &#x2013; Duabus sellis sedet. &#x2013; Ex eodem ore calidum et frigidum efflare. (<hi rendition="#i">Masson, 248.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Poln.</hi>: Zimno i ciep&#x0142;o z jednej g&#x0119;by chucho&#x0107;. (<hi rendition="#i">Masson, 248.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Schwed.</hi>: Wända kappan efter winden. (<hi rendition="#i">Marin, 28.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
