</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Maultrommel.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*1 Die Maultrommel rühren.</hi></p>                <lb/>
