</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Maulwerk.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">1 Viel Maulwerk, wenig Herz. (S. Ha</hi>nd  56 u.  725.) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Gaal, 1764; Masson, 59.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">It.</hi>: Assai parole e poche lance rotte. (<hi rendition="#i">Gaal, 1764.</hi>) &#x2013; Chi teme, brava. &#x2013; Tal ha paura, ch'a minacciar ardisce. (<hi rendition="#i">Masson, 59.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
