<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*3 De hat 'n Mûlwerk, dat'n Ratt'n un Müs daomit vergäwen kann.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Altmark.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Danneil, 275.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*4 De hat'n gôd Mûlwerk.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Altmark.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Danneil, 14.</hi></p>                <lb/>
