</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Muthig.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*1 De is di to modig.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Dähnert, 212<hi rendition="#sup">a</hi>.</hi></p>                <lb/>
