<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Qui famae credit saepe mentitur cum fama. (<hi rendition="#i">Gaal, 911.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Nachrennen.</hi></head>                <lb/>
