<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">1 Buawen (oben) glatt un bunt, un unnen (unten) nicks as Strunt.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Münster.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frommann, VI, 428.</hi></p>                <lb/>
