<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">2 Alt ochsen tretten hart.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Franck, II, 14<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>; Lehmann, II, 27, 32; Körte, 4637; Braun, I, 3116.</hi></p>                <lb/>
