<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">* Du Pelzkosak.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Frischbier<hi rendition="#sup">2</hi>, 2889.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et">Scherzender Zuruf an Kinder.</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Pelzmütze.</hi></head>                <lb/>
