<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Engl.</hi>: Penny-wise and pound-foolish. (<hi rendition="#i">Bohn II, 174.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Holl.</hi>: Centen-wijsheid en daalder-domheid. (<hi rendition="#i">Bohn I, 302.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
