<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Böhm.</hi>: V&#x0115;t&#x015B;í dým ne&#x017E;li pe&#x010D;enka. (<hi rendition="#i">&#x010C;elakovský, 103.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">It.</hi>: Molto fummo e poco arrosto. (<hi rendition="#i">Gaal, 686.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">74 Viel Rauch, wenig Feuer.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et">In Hannover: Väl Râk un wänig Füer.</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">75 Vnser Rauch ist heisser, denn eines andern.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Lehmann, II, 792, 109; Simrock, 8146; Körte, 4930.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">76 War Rôk is, is ôk Füer, hadde de Junge segt, as he 'n frisken Pêrdekötel upnehmen sull.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Ostfries.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Bueren, 1219; Hoefer, 535; Kern, 210.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">77 War Rôk is, is ôk Für.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Hauskalender, I.</hi></p>                <lb/>
