<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*315 A rätt asu vo d'r Lâw'r wäg, doass d' Hoanne gockan.</hi> (<hi rendition="#i">Oesterr.-Schles.</hi>) &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Peter, I, 445.</hi></p>                <lb/>
