<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Perspicito tecum tacitus, quid quisque loquatur, sermo hominum mores et celat et indicat idem. (<hi rendition="#i">Cato.</hi>) (<hi rendition="#i">Eiselein, 523.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*486 Sie redet wie aus dem Sacke geschüttet.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Klix, 74.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">
<pb facs="#f0801" n="[787]"/>
<cb n="1573"/>
