<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Qui tacet ut mutus, raro fit munere tutus. (<hi rendition="#i">Sutor, 904.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Schwed.</hi>: Han talar få ord med god besked. (<hi rendition="#i">Törning, 53.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*492 Wann er redt, so kräet die axt vnnder dem banck.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Franck, II, 54<hi rendition="#sup">a</hi>.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*493 Wann er redt, so zittert der backoff.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Franck, II, 54<hi rendition="#sup">a</hi>; Suringar, XIX, 4.</hi></p>                <lb/>
