<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*3 Es sind leere Redensarten.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Verba, praetereaque nihil. (<hi rendition="#i">Binder II, 3502.</hi>) &#x2013; Viscus merus vestra est blanditia. (<hi rendition="#i">Plautus.</hi>) (<hi rendition="#i">Philippi, II, 257.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">*4 Nur keine Redensarten.</hi></p>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Frz.</hi>: Sans phrase. (<hi rendition="#i">Büchmann, 179.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Reder.</hi></head>                <lb/>
