<p rendition="#et2"><hi rendition="#i">Lat.</hi>: Qualia quisque geret, talia quisque feret. (<hi rendition="#i">Binder I, 1432; II, 2721; Egeria, 237; Fischer, 185, 10; Philippi, II, 120; Seybold, 472; Schreger, 46.</hi>) &#x2013; Quisque suae vitae semina jacta metet. &#x2013; Ut sementem feceris, ita metes. (<hi rendition="#i">Eiselein, 536; Tappius, 143<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>; Gaal, 1335; Fischer, 185, 10.</hi>)</p>                <lb/>
