</div>             <div n="2" type="lexiconEntry">                <head><hi rendition="#b">Salz.</hi></head>                <lb/>
<p rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#larger">1 Das saltz geht hin, daher es kompt.</hi> &#x2013; <hi rendition="#i">Franck, I, 53<hi rendition="#sup">b</hi>.</hi></p>                <lb/>
